    "Artifacts: current navigation selects Version 16 while retaining Version 15 history. New release links name the agreed future Version 16 assets; this review does not claim those assets already exist. No Busy Beaver specialization enters the selected manuscript.",
    "Checker: exact original eight replacements, original AI-statement amendment and unique two-line precision amendment reconstruct the complete current manuscript; original review hashes retain the old source scope. Assertions, build/PDF hashes and selected manifest entries are finite checks, not authentication or proof.",
    "Evidence: original scoped reviews remain byte-bound to their original targets. Current correction, native coverage and assembly reports disclose reuse and limitations and do not claim an already completed protected App decision. The archived pre-precision source preserves the old bytes.",
    "Native structural review: current dossier, connection record, source extensions and review decision hashes agree. 8300 locations across 205 distinct pins checked; 126 coverage rows, 1190 uses, 1170 connections, 40 findings. Native field helpers and source-byte checks were used without fabricating receipts.",
    "Archive implementation: checks the exact prior ZIP hash, embeds it unchanged, selects manifest and explicit intervening paths, refuses existing output, validates source hashes and reads back overlay member hashes. It does not recursively publish private working directories."
